# gpio-keys keylayout for Xiaomi Mi 6 (sagit)
# Volume keys come from the qpnp/gpio-keys device.
# Back/menu/home are reported by the Synaptics DSX touchscreen (keycodes
# 158/139/102) and Generic.kl already maps those, so they are not repeated
# here. verify-me: `getevent -p` to see which input device carries them.
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
